flowchart TD
  A[Upstream URL] --> B[Exact commit pin]
  B --> C[Clone / partial fetch]
  C --> D[Static repo audit]
  D --> E[License + security + dependency review]
  E --> F{Reuse mode?}
  F -->|SDK/service| G[Adapter integration]
  F -->|Selective source| H[Stage exact path + SHA-256]
  F -->|Fork| I[Dedicated fork/worktree]
  F -->|Rewrite| J[Written rationale and ADR]
  H --> K[Carry tests + notices]
  I --> K
  G --> L[ORBIT conformance/security tests]
  K --> L
  J --> L
  L --> M{Independent QA + security + legal gates}
  M -->|Pass| N[Human-approved PR / release]
  M -->|Fail| O[Fix / reject / rollback]
